ава 1"}]},{"tagName":"h2","type":"text","classes":[{"name":"lr-chapter-title","private":true}],"attributes":{"data-anim":"fade-up","id":"ihir2"},"components":[{"type":"textnode","content":"АСУРА ПЕНЗА ГОТОВИТСЯ ТОПТАТЬ"}]}]},{"classes":[{"name":"lr-text","private":true}],"components":[{"tagName":"p","type":"text","attributes":{"id":"iihfo"},"components":[{"type":"textnode","content":"Ебало Туза, когда мы этой хуйнёй просто рынок местный сломаем представил? "}]},{"tagName":"p","type":"text","attributes":{"id":"ia88f"},"components":[{"type":"textnode","content":"Очень бы хотел, чтоб он потом в свой ТГ повысирал типа "},{"tagName":"i","components":[{"tagName":"span","type":"text","attributes":{"id":"ikaz08"},"components":[{"type":"textnode","content":"\"очередное говносми\""}]}]}]}]},{"tagName":"figure","classes":[{"name":"lr-figure","private":true},{"name":"lr-figure--wide","private":true}],"attributes":{"data-anim":"fade-up"},"components":[{"classes":[{"name":"lr-media","private":true}],"components":[{"type":"image","resizable":{"ratioDefault":1},"attributes":{"src":"/uploads/20261117-012625-4a4f3e3203.jpg","alt":"","id":"iv1o7"}}]},{"tagName":"figcaption","type":"text","classes":[{"name":"lr-caption","private":true}],"components":[{"type":"textnode","content":"Подпись к фото. Фото: автор"}]}]},{"tagName":"blockquote","classes":[{"name":"lr-quote","private":true}],"attributes":{"data-anim":"fade-up"},"components":[{"tagName":"p","type":"text","attributes":{"id":"iwwvi"},"components":[{"type":"textnode","content":"Я жрал говно, чтоб вам не пришлось, пацаны"}]},{"tagName":"cite","type":"text","classes":[{"name":"lr-quote-author","private":true}],"attributes":{"id":"ih534"},"components":[{"type":"textnode","content":"Владимир сорокин"}]}]},{"tagName":"section","classes":[{"name":"lr-split","private":true}],"components":[{"classes":[{"name":"lr-split-media","private":true}],"attributes":{"data-anim":"slide-left"},"components":[{"classes":[{"name":"lr-media","private":tru